# {{.Name}}

A Go HTTP service generated by [goforge](https://github.com/zaid/goforge).

## Quick Start

```bash
# Copy and configure environment
cp .env.example .env
{{- if .UsePostgres}}

# Start PostgreSQL and run migrations
# Update DATABASE_URL in .env first
make migrate-up
{{- end}}

# Run the service
make run

# Test it
curl http://localhost:8080/healthz
curl http://localhost:8080/api/v1/examples
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/examples -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"name":"hello"}'
```

## Commands

```bash
make run      # Start the service
make build    # Compile binary to bin/
make test     # Run all tests
make lint     # Run linter
make clean    # Remove build artifacts
```
{{if .Docker}}
## Docker

